---
import Footer from '@/components/Footer/Footer.astro'
import Header from '@/components/Header/Header.astro'
import PageHeader from '@/components/PageHeader/PageHeader.astro'
import BaseLayout from '@/layouts/BaseLayout.astro'
---

<BaseLayout
  title='Legal Disclaimer - The Lenders'
  description='Important legal information and disclaimers regarding The Lenders mortgage and home loan services.'
>
  <Header />

  <main class='main'>
    <PageHeader title='Legal Disclaimer' />

    <section style='padding-block: clamp(3rem, 4vw, 5rem); background-color: var(--color-white); color: var(--color-blue-500);'>
      <style>
        .disclaimer-list {
          list-style: none;
          padding-left: 0;
          display: flex;
          flex-direction: column;
          gap: 0.75rem;
        }
        .disclaimer-list li {
          position: relative;
          padding-left: 2rem;
        }
        .disclaimer-list li::before {
          content: '✓';
          position: absolute;
          left: 0;
          color: var(--color-gold-400);
          font-weight: bold;
          font-size: 1.25rem;
        }
      </style>
      <div class='container' style='max-width: 920px;'>
        <div style='display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 2rem;'>
          <div>
            <h2>General Information</h2>
            <p>
              The information provided on The Lenders website is for general informational purposes only. 
              All information on the site is provided in good faith; however, we make no representation or 
              warranty of any kind, express or implied, regarding the accuracy, adequacy, validity, reliability, 
              availability, or completeness of any information on the site.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div>
            <h2>Not Financial or Legal Advice</h2>
            <p>
              The content on this website does not constitute financial, legal, tax, or any other professional 
              advice. The information provided is general in nature and should not be relied upon as a substitute 
              for consultation with professional advisors. Before making any financial decision, including applying 
              for a mortgage or home loan, you should consult with qualified financial, legal, and tax professionals.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div>
            <h2>Mortgage and Loan Information</h2>
            <p>
              All mortgage rates, terms, and products displayed on this website are subject to change without notice. 
              The information provided regarding loan products, interest rates, fees, and terms is for illustrative 
              purposes only and does not constitute a commitment to lend or an offer of credit.
            </p>
            <p style='margin-top: 1rem;'>
              Actual rates, terms, and conditions may vary based on individual circumstances including but not limited to:
            </p>
            <ul class='disclaimer-list' style='margin-top: 0.75rem;'>
              <li>Credit score and credit history</li>
              <li>Loan-to-value ratio</li>
              <li>Property type and location</li>
              <li>Employment and income verification</li>
              <li>Debt-to-income ratio</li>
              <li>Down payment amount</li>
            </ul>
          </div>

          <div>
            <h2>Calculators and Tools</h2>
            <p>
              The mortgage calculators and other financial tools provided on this website are for estimation purposes 
              only. Results are based on the information you provide and certain assumptions about interest rates, 
              taxes, insurance, and other factors. Actual loan amounts, payments, and terms may differ. These tools 
              should not be used as the sole basis for financial decisions.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div>
            <h2>No Guarantee of Approval</h2>
            <p>
              Submission of a loan application or pre-qualification request does not guarantee loan approval. 
              All applications are subject to underwriting review and approval. The Lenders reserves the right 
              to deny any application that does not meet our underwriting guidelines or for any other reason 
              permitted by law.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div>
            <h2>NMLS Consumer Access</h2>
            <p>
              The Lenders is a licensed mortgage lender. NMLS ID: [XXXXXXX]. Licensed by [State Regulatory Authority]. 
              For licensing information, visit <a href='http://www.nmlsconsumeraccess.org' target='_blank' rel='noopener noreferrer' style='color: var(--color-blue-400); text-decoration: underline;'>www.nmlsconsumeraccess.org</a>.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div>
            <h2>Equal Housing Opportunity</h2>
            <p>
              The Lenders is an Equal Housing Lender. We comply with all federal, state, and local fair lending laws. 
              We do not discriminate on the basis of race, color, religion, national origin, sex, familial status, 
              disability, marital status, age, sexual orientation, or any other protected class under applicable law.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div>
            <h2>External Links</h2>
            <p>
              This website may contain links to external websites that are not provided or maintained by The Lenders. 
              We do not guarantee the accuracy, relevance, timeliness, or completeness of any information on external 
              websites. The inclusion of any links does not imply recommendation or endorsement of the views expressed 
              within them.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div>
            <h2>Website Availability</h2>
            <p>
              We make every effort to keep the website up and running smoothly. However, The Lenders takes no 
              responsibility for, and will not be liable for, the website being temporarily unavailable due to 
              technical issues beyond our control.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div>
            <h2>Changes to Information</h2>
            <p>
              The Lenders reserves the right to modify, add, or remove any information on this website at any time 
              without prior notice. We recommend that you periodically review this disclaimer for any changes. 
              Your continued use of the website following the posting of changes constitutes your acceptance of 
              such changes.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div>
            <h2>State-Specific Disclosures</h2>
            <p>
              Additional disclosures may be required based on the state in which you are applying for a mortgage. 
              State-specific disclosures will be provided during the application process as required by law.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div>
            <h2>Limitation of Liability</h2>
            <p>
              Under no circumstance shall The Lenders have any liability to you for any loss or damage of any kind 
              incurred as a result of the use of the site or reliance on any information provided on the site. 
              Your use of the site and your reliance on any information on the site is solely at your own risk.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div>
            <h2>Contact Information</h2>
            <p>
              If you have questions about this Legal Disclaimer or any information on our website, please contact us:
            </p>
            <ul class='disclaimer-list' style='margin-top: 1rem;'>
              <li><strong>Email:</strong> <a href='mailto:legal@thelenders.com' style='color: var(--color-blue-400); text-decoration: underline;'>legal@thelenders.com</a></li>
              <li><strong>Phone:</strong> <a href='tel:1-800-123-4567' style='color: var(--color-blue-400); text-decoration: underline;'>1-800-123-4567</a></li>
            </ul>
          </div>

          <div style='padding: 1.5rem; background-color: rgba(0, 71, 171, 0.05); border-radius: 8px; margin-top: 1rem;'>
            <p style='margin: 0; font-size: 0.95rem;'>
              <strong>Last Updated:</strong> November 17, 2025
            </p>
          </div>

          <div style='padding: 1.5rem; background-color: rgba(255, 215, 0, 0.1); border-left: 4px solid var(--color-gold-400); margin-top: 1rem;'>
            <p style='margin: 0; font-size: 0.95rem; font-weight: var(--fw-600);'>
              IMPORTANT: This disclaimer is intended to provide general information and does not create an 
              attorney-client relationship. For specific legal advice, please consult with a qualified attorney.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>

  <Footer />
</BaseLayout>
